# The build clones its source and copies nothing from this context, so
# everything here is upload cost. Most of these are also the runtime paths on
# the host, where the clone directory doubles as it: data/ holds
# auth.db and the transcripts, and .env holds CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN. A build
# run from that directory would otherwise send all of it to the daemon.
data/
claude/
.env
.env.image
.git/
